@startuml UC-P2-manage-project-members-analysis-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
title UC-P2 Manage project members (analysis: system sequence)
' Analysis level (decision 9): the person and Playground as one box. No outside system takes part.
' Alpha scope (decision 13): only an administrator changes members, members and administrators see inside,
' anyone else gets the same answer as for a project that does not exist. No project roles.
' No route, store, port, adapter, token or cookie. Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-P2.
' Not drawn: the affected person's next request (step 8).

actor "Caller" as U
participant "Playground" as PG #E6F0FB

U -> PG : 1 open a project\nand its members
U -> PG : 2 add or remove\n3 (add) the person
alt neither a member nor\nan administrator
  PG --> U : 4 same answer as\na missing project
else a member, not an administrator
  PG --> U : 4 refused
else an administrator
  alt person to add not active
    PG --> U : 5 refused, one answer
  else person to remove is not a member
    PG --> U : refused
  else
    PG -> PG : 6 apply the change
    PG -> PG : 7 record who, what, whom
    PG --> U : updated members
  end
end
@enduml
